    "preamble": "S.Muralidharan vs Tamil Nadu State Marketing Corporation ... on 24 January, 2025 Author: Senthilkumar Ramamoorthy Bench: Senthilkumar Ramamoorthy W.P.No.19 In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 24.01.2025 Coram : The Hon'Ble Mr.K.R.Shriram, Chief Justice And The Hon'Ble Mr.Justice Senthilkumar Ramamoorthy W.P.No.19502 of 2024 & W.M.P.Nos.21355 & 21356 of 2024 S.Muralidharan .. Petitioner Vs. 1. Tamil Nadu State Marketing Corporation (Tasmac) Rep. by the Managing Director Cmda Tower Ii, Iv Floor Gandhi Irwin Bridge Road Egmore, Chennai 600 008. 2. Home, Prohibition and Excise Department Rep. by Principal Secretary Secretariat, Fort St. George Chennai 600 009. 3. The State of Tamil Nadu Rep. by the Chief Secretary Secretariat, Fort St. George Chennai 09. __________ Page 1 of 6 S.Muralidharan vs Tamil Nadu State Marketing Corporation ... on 24 January, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/160168222/ 1 https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis W.P.No. 4. Serious Fraud Investigation Office Rep. by Director Corporate Bhawan, Ground Floor No.29, Rajaji Salai, Chennai 600 001. 5. National Consumer Dispute Redressal Commission Rep. by the President Upbhokta Nyay Bhavan, F Block Gpo Complex, Ina, New Delhi 110 023. 6. Food Safety and Standards Authority of India Rep. by Regional Director 2nd Floor, South Wing North Beach Road Port Trust, Rajaji Salai, Chennai 600 001. .. Responden [R4 & R5 deleted vide this order]",
